{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09369","headline":"游琅瑘山寺 · 韦应物","name":"游琅瑘山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受命恤人隐，兹游久未遑。\n鸣驺响幽涧，前旌耀崇冈。\n青冥台砌寒，绿褥草木香。\n填壑跻花界，叠石构云房。\n经制随岩转，缭绕岂定方。\n新泉泄阴壁，高萝荫绿塘。\n攀林一栖止，饮水得清凉。\n物累诚可遣，疲甿终未忘。\n还归坐郡阁，但见山苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}